#: ../../quick-reference.rst:111
msgid ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` gives a load balancer with no "
"firewall. TCP and UDP frontends never use the firewall."
msgstr ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` da un balanceador de carga sin "
"cortafuegos. Los frontends TCP y UDP nunca usan el cortafuegos."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:113
msgid ""
"The operator console of the edge (SID 0031) needs a ``console`` section "
"in the file:"
msgstr ""
"La consola del operador del edge (SID 0031) necesita una sección "
"``console`` en el archivo:"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:115
msgid ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", "
"node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # once, while the "
"daemon is stopped\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # then open "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ and the page Edge\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # the "
"node, its frontends and its pools\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # one "
"row for each member\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:125
msgid ""
"The command route takes ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add server``, "
"``del server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` and ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca``, each with the checks of ``sibuna ctl``. It "
"needs the role of an operator."
msgstr ""
"La ruta de comandos admite ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add "
"server``, ``del server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` y ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca``, cada uno con las comprobaciones de ``sibuna "
"ctl``. Necesita el rol de operador."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:127
msgid ""
"Admission options of a frontend (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": \"5s\"`` "
"and ``\"backlog\": 4096`` on ``tcp`` and ``http``; ``\"inspect_bytes\"`` "
"and ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": {\"action\": \"deny\"}}`` beside "
"``tcp_inspect``; ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"`` on ``udp``. All are off by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Opciones de admisión de un frontend (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": "
"\"5s\"`` y ``\"backlog\": 4096`` en ``tcp`` y ``http``; "
"``\"inspect_bytes\"`` e ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": {\"action\": "
"\"deny\"}}`` junto a ``tcp_inspect``; ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"`` en "
"``udp``. Todas están desactivadas por defecto."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:129
msgid "Console (opt-in preview)"
msgstr "Consola (versión preliminar opcional)"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:132
msgid ""
"# Initialize while the daemon is stopped, then start the console\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"
msgstr ""
"# Inicializa con el daemon detenido y después arranca la consola\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir ./data\n"
"sibuna --data-dir ./data --console 127.0.0.1:19446"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:138
msgid ""
"Open ``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` and replace the temporary "
"password. Add ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` to place the node on "
"the globe. Remote access requires an HTTPS proxy, an explicit origin and "
"trusted-proxy CIDRs; follow Part XI. SID 0007 is Committed. The console "
"passes its browser workflows in headless Chromium (SID 0010, criterion "
"5); its formal performance isolation gate remains open (Part X)."
msgstr ""
"Abre ``http://127.0.0.1:19446/console/`` y sustituye la contraseña "
"temporal. Añade ``--console-location 1.3521,103.8198`` para situar el "
"nodo en el globo. El acceso remoto requiere un proxy HTTPS, un origen "
"explícito y los CIDR de los proxies de confianza; sigue la parte XI. El "
"SID 0007 está en estado Committed. La consola supera sus flujos de "
"trabajo de navegador en Chromium sin interfaz gráfica (SID 0010, criterio "
"5); su criterio formal de aislamiento del rendimiento sigue abierto "
"(parte X)."

